==Battleground==
*10 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*60 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Metal enemies are extremely weak: the Croconators spawn very quickly and serve as a cash flow, while the Super Metal Hippoes are only 200% and have low health. Using Research combos with meatshields, [[Crazed Giraffe Cat]], and [[Catasaurus]] is a free win.

